{"v":4,"catch":"雙搖杆砍人者游戲，你的武器會爆炸","desc":"我們將經典街機遊戲的元素與現代感融為一體，為你帶來了 Breakpoint：一個自上而下的得分追逐遊戲，帶有會爆炸的近戰武器，富有挑戰性。\n\n在雙搖桿方案的情節中，你無法使用遠程攻擊。您只能切割、壓碎和爆破，從而突破敵群。請將武器推至爆破點，對敵人實施毀滅性爆炸。對武器進行爆破、充能和再次爆破，以求生存。","publisher":"The Quantum Astrophysicists Guild","release":"2021-01-21","genres":["動作","街機","射擊","策略"],"players":"單機 1 人","langs":["日文","英文","葡萄牙文","西班牙文","法文","德文","意大利文","荷蘭文","俄文","韓文","中文 (簡體字)","中文 (繁體字)"],"pmax":1,"poff":1,"rating":"NONE","size":"Switch 2 0.5GB / Switch 0.5GB","modes":["TV 模式","桌上模式","手提模式"],"shots":["https://img-eshop.cdn.nintendo.net/i/ac13788e830bca33941e997ad21dc1c3ffa0bb3353195bc5529d4d69d8292539.jpg","https://img-eshop.cdn.nintendo.net/i/7e21ddffc16f83c01ab3d3d184e201181ec4e980369a55a68e66160e8ab6d494.jpg","https://img-eshop.cdn.nintendo.net/i/0d41a60d7cbcaa02ca2316388789142f824a1c703007bb2d921cf6c7a30f253a.jpg","https://img-eshop.cdn.nintendo.net/i/6d0580452190c8bf307ea826b3e7b75232b9e83308b9f14fed977cb4494e27e6.jpg","https://img-eshop.cdn.nintendo.net/i/16d4358cf02233c5ebc7dc5b23563b05514182dad0dcbb3158451f6fafd5d087.jpg","https://img-eshop.cdn.nintendo.net/i/e2fe576e3622c770ec677171d484cc60d45ec3455f6d74497db1eb4bf53dc5a5.jpg"],"titleId":"0100b010114e4000","dlc":[]}